(7614390, 1232500, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine composition in which the boxiness is a supporting player that helps convey the mood.  The color palette is harmonious.  Though cool, I somehow feel a warmth coming through, which is interesting (to me).  I also like that he is flanked by windows that are made opaque by the view behind them, contributing to the boxed in undercurrent.</td>', 'Fine composition in which the boxiness is a supporting player that helps convey the mood.  The color palette is harmonious.  Though cool, I somehow feel a warmth coming through, which is interesting (to me).  I also like that he is flanked by windows that are made opaque by the view behind them, contributing to the boxed in undercurrent.', '2019-02-20 08:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7614394, 1232481, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, a favorite of mine, that superbly utilizes a boxy composition to organize the shifting planes.  It can be appreciated as a flat abstraction, yet its charming dimensions offer the eye a dainty adventure.  The circular outlet that, with its reflection, hints at infinity is a marvelous touch.  Entrancing.</td>', 'Beautiful image, a favorite of mine, that superbly utilizes a boxy composition to organize the shifting planes.  It can be appreciated as a flat abstraction, yet its charming dimensions offer the eye a dainty adventure.  The circular outlet that, with its reflection, hints at infinity is a marvelous touch.  Entrancing.', '2019-02-20 09:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7614395, 1232368, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to offer an obliquely boxy composition.  If one uses imagination to hover overhead, the veiled boxiness comes to life.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to offer an obliquely boxy composition.  If one uses imagination to hover overhead, the veiled boxiness comes to life.', '2019-02-20 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
