(7614436, 1232420, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this so much!!!  I wanna know where you put the trigger!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I had cut a hole in the box next to my right hand. I hid the trigger under the box lid and used a 2 second delay. I cloned out the wire connecting the trigger to the camera that was suspended above in an opening above our foyer.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-02-20 15:19:10.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I love this so much!!!  I wanna know where you put the trigger!!   I had cut a hole in the box next to my right hand. I hid the trigger under the box lid and used a 2 second delay. I cloned out the wire connecting the trigger to the camera that was suspended above in an opening above our foyer.', '2019-02-20 13:44:05.000000', '2019-02-20 15:19:10.000000', 0),
